  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 750eb (Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1<br>\n<strong>Fits:</strong> All Assault Rifles, Sniper Rifles, and Shotguns that use detachable magazines (e.g., double barrel shotguns are not compatible) and do not have an equipped Belt Box or Backpack Magazine</p>\n<p>When the magazine is empty and you hold the weapon two-handed, give up your Move Action to reload without an Action. The Coupler is then spent until reset with an Action; normal Reload Actions still work. The weapon can't be concealed or used as a Popup Weapon.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Capacity &amp; Reloading).</em></p>"
